# The waitlist form is a Netlify Form, which only works on Netlify, so the
# signup page stays there on join.legacywealthgame.com while the rest of the
# site moves. The root is the signup page today, so hand it off rather than
# serving a copy whose form would silently fail to record anyone.
/  https://join.legacywealthgame.com/  302

# /command is gated by a Netlify edge function, which does not run here, so
# serving a copy would publish the dashboard with no password at all. Send it
# back to the Netlify host where the gate still works. The .html form is listed
# too so the raw file cannot be fetched directly.
#
# /legacypitch is deliberately NOT redirected. It is served from here and calls
# the Cloudflare function at /api/pitch. Redirecting it moved the page onto the
# join subdomain, which the pitch endpoint's origin allowlist rejects.
/command            https://join.legacywealthgame.com/command      302
/command.html       https://join.legacywealthgame.com/command      302
